#Протокол_Codegen_Evidence_Contract_V1<[
Базис:
  ioHasC codegen/compiler-mode steps производят generated code; Work Graph tasks должны доказывать integrity, round-trip и generated tests через Evidence v1.
  protocols/evidence-model-v1.bvc задаёт базовые type/status; codegen contract добавляет специализированные evidence kinds для compiler pipeline.
Вектор:
  codegen.evidence.record.v1 kinds:
  - integrity — generated output matches expected hash or diff is reviewed (artifacts: generated files, integrityHash)
  - roundtrip — step/compiler-mode round-trip succeeded (command, exitCode, artifacts: step path + generated paths)
  - generated_test — tests covering generated surface passed (command, exitCode, artifacts: test report)
  Drift blocker: если integrity hash изменился без matching roundtrip evidence → verify gate blocked.
  Mapping в Evidence v1: type=test|command, summary human-readable, details.codegenKind = integrity|roundtrip|generated_test.
Цель:
  Codegen становится deterministic verify step в Work Graph, а не ad-hoc CLI log.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  protocol.id: codegen-evidence-contract-v1
  work.source: design-codegen-evidence-contract
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Integrity_And_Drift_Gates<[
Базис:
  Generated file drift без evidence должно блокировать done/verify для codegen-facing WorkItems.
Вектор:
  WorkItem labels:
  trace.codegen_integrity_hash — optional expected hash of generated artifact set
  trace.codegen_source_step — compiler-mode or Vector DSL source .bvc path
  evaluateCodegenVerifyGate() проверяет наличие integrity + roundtrip evidence перед done.
  mismatch integrity → blocker evidence type blocker с code codegen.integrity_drift.
Цель:
  Regenerated code не попадает в done без явной verification chain.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: codegen-integrity-gates-v1
  protocol.id: codegen-evidence-contract-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>
